# setuptools' default sdist rules match only tests/test*.py, which silently
# omitted tests/conftest.py. The shipped suite then produced 26 passed / 57
# errors — every test depending on a fixture failed at setup. Anyone auditing
# sbic-tracker from PyPI saw a broken test suite for a release whose entire
# claim is that it no longer reports invented numbers.
recursive-include tests *.py

include README.md
include pyproject.toml
include setup.py

global-exclude *.pyc __pycache__/*
